o+%26+Killa+Punch%29", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=A.W.O%2C+Mr+JazziQ+%26+King+P+PHEZ%27KWENDLU+%28feat.+Miano+%26+Killa+Punch%29", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/A.W.O%2C+Mr+JazziQ+%26+King+P+PHEZ%27KWENDLU+%28feat.+Miano+%26+Killa+Punch%29", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/1802633347", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/A.W.O%2C+Mr+JazziQ+%26+King+P+PHEZ%27KWENDLU+%28feat.+Miano+%26+Killa+Punch%29", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=A.W.O%2C+Mr+JazziQ+%26+King+P+PHEZ%27KWENDLU+%28feat.+Miano+%26+Killa+Punch%29&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2025 BOATS ENT."]}, {"t": 3405, "time": "00:56:45", "artist": "W4DE & Royal Musiq", "title": "TEZE", "conf": "mid", "links": [{"label": "bandcamp", "url": "https://bandcamp.com/search?q=W4DE+%26+Royal+Musiq+TEZE", "search": true}, {"label": "youtube", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=W4DE+%26+Royal+Musiq+TEZE", "search": true}, {"label": "soundcloud", "url": "https://soundcloud.com/search?q=W4DE+%26+Royal+Musiq+TEZE", "search": true}, {"label": "spotify", "url": "https://open.spotify.com/search/W4DE+%26+Royal+Musiq+TEZE", "search": true}, {"label": "apple", "url": "https://music.apple.com/au/song/6794249810", "search": false}, {"label": "deezer", "url": "https://www.deezer.com/search/W4DE+%26+Royal+Musiq+TEZE", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=W4DE+%26+Royal+Musiq+TEZE&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["2026 Kreative Kornerr"]}], "counts": {"high": 1, "mid": 10, "low": 5}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:13:57", "end": "00:15:49", "text": "You are tuned in to The Honour Show on FBi Radio 94.5 with myself, DJ TeeSoul, back for another week. I hope you've all been doing well, listening to a lot of good music, because you know what this show is about. And this song here is called My House. It's by Just Gigi and featuring T-Man Express on vocals at the moment. and this has been such a good album for me to kind of listen to try to understand and put into my sets I think Just Gigi outdone herself with this one every time I listen to a track on this album I'm thinking even just the choice of samples she sampled a lot of old house vocals and I love a good sample if you can do it well keep doing it I think she did a good job picking the samples even just producers that she had on with her as well to put out the album with she chose some great producers the sound that's currently being pushed in the I'm a piano scene I think she's done such a good job of highlighting that and the sound that's that's kind of brought her to where she's at now she I would say is an emerging producer and DJ at the moment and this project was personally to me 10 out of 10 um go stream that if you like you'll love you know a lot of the samples if you are a house head they are quite recognizable and i've i've loved playing them in my sets personally don't really know where we're going this week with the music but you know what happens it's usually good anyways but stay tuned if you have anything to let me know send me a text on 0435 123 945 stay tuned"}, {"start": "00:54:31", "end": "00:56:13", "text": "You are tuned into The Yanos Show on FBi Radio 94.5 and somehow we're already at the end of this week's show. Again, I get caught up in it. I look at the time and there's five minutes left. I think that's crazy personally. But I hope you had a time. I had a time. Played some new tracks. There's been a lot of new albums recently. I told you they're even dropping on Thursday nights now to beat the Friday crowd for New Music Friday. but off the top of my head 031 Chopper dropped an album um who else dropped an album Uncle MC dropped an album and it's interesting to see an MC drop an album I think that is very important if you know who Uncle MC is he's probably the biggest MC in the game I would say he's if not featured on every other song these days he's playing or he's emceeing at every other event he just knows how to shake a crowd in my opinion search him up you'll see what i'm talking about but to see an emcee drop music is very interesting it's different but i think what he put out was really good actually there was a couple tracks i was waiting on personally and i'm happy they're out now and i think it gives inspiration to the emcees that are coming up especially locally and things like that so if you want to get onto that mc game please give him a listen but i hope you all had a good time during this hour with me i'll be back same time same place for exactly the same vibes stay safe everyone stay warm this was the honor show"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:02:11"}, "track": {"title": "Emazweni (feat. Nia Pearl, Rory Diamondz & Mashudu)", "artists": [{"name": "Tycoon"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:03:00"}, "track": {"title": "uMoya 2.0 (feat. Soulful Disciple) [Tycoon Remix]", "artists": [{"name": "Darque"}, {"name": "Atmos Blaq"}, {"name": "Zawadi Yamungu & Tycoon"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:08:00"}, "track": {"title": "Market Place 2.0 (feat. The Bless)", "artists": [{"name": "Stixx & Hugh Masekela"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:13:00"}, "track": {"title": "My House (feat. Tman Xpress)", "artists": [{"name": "Jussgigi & Boips"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "high"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:16:00"}, "track": {"title": "Rube", "artists": [{"name": "Pandreas"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:17:00"}, "track": {"title": "Happy Joy (Pe Pe Pe) [feat. 